8162247,2024-01-12,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Closing your account,Company closed your account,"Dear US Bank, After exhausting all reasonable avenues for resolution within your customer service channels, XXXX  and CFPB, I am formally requesting arbitration to seek a fair and expeditious settlement. 

