8259075,2024-01-31,Debt or credit management,Debt settlement,Didn't provide services promised,,"On XX/XX/XXXX, I signed up with Clear One Advantage, a debt consolidation company, after a friend recommended it. The representative suggested including debts with the highest balances. I agreed, thinking Clear One Advantage would negotiate with my creditors to settle for less than what I owed. 

